  "slug": "joes-perfect-anti-sour-mix-margarita",
  "name": "Joe's Perfect Anti-Sour Mix Margarita",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "Joe's perfect anti-sour mix margarita recipe is for you if you're tired of mediocre margaritas with stomach-souring sour mix. Try it on the rocks.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Pour salt onto a small, shallow plate. Moisten rim of a large glass with water; dip into salt. Fill glass with ice; set aside."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker with ice; add tequila, orange liqueur, and lime juice. Cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted. Strain into the prepared glass; slowly add grapefruit soda."
    }
  ],
